  "description": "Head turning, mind blowing\nOur top of the range ELyte EVO Stag Works is the dream bike of our design and engineering team, made real for you: full-power (600W), full-torque (85Nm) – all the time – so you can make the most of your precious time. With a full carbon frame, our lowest centre of gravity ever for the finest, most capable handling, mixed (MX) wheels (29er front, 27.5in rear), and the latest Bosch CX motor, ELyte EVO Stag Works delivers the very best mountain bike handling and ride feel with full-power capability so you can get more out of every ride.\n\nHighlights\n– 150mm front + 142mm rear of custom-tuned suspension travel.\n– Uni-directional carbon fibre frame is light and reassuringly strong.\n– Bosch's new Performance Line CX full-torque (85Nm), full-power (600W) motor.\n– 650Wh of combined battery (400Wh internal + 250Wh PowerMore range extender) so you can ride further.\n– MX wheels (29er front, 27.5in rear) so you can tackle the techiest terrain.\n– 492.28mm complete bike centre of gravity for the best handling possible.\n\nNo compromises, no half measures\nThe ELyte EVO Stag Works is specced to perform flawlessly from the shop floor so you can focus on what really matters: getting the most from your ride. Top-shelf Fox Factory suspension front and rear tames the roughest trails with ease; SRAM's XO T-Type AXS electronic gearing gives you reliably impeccable shifting performance; richly powerful Hope Tech 4 V4 four-piston hydraulic disc brakes deliver the ultimate in braking control; Hope cranks and hubs; traction-rich Maxxis tyres; and more. It’s the finest trail-proven kit to serve you perfectly, wherever and however hard you ride.\n\nCharge time: 50% in 1.5hrs from empty, and to 100% in 3.5hrs.\n\nELyte EVO Stag Works: full-torque, full-power – all the time.",
